OL,3,GNEWSAHouse damaged in petrol bomb
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA house in Ballymoney has been damaged
OL,7,Fin an arson attack in the early hours
OL,8,Fof Friday.
OL,10,FPolice said they received a report at
OL,11,Fabout midnight that a suspected petrol
OL,12,Fbomb had been thrown at a property in
OL,13,Fthe Carnany Drive area.
OL,15,FThe Northern Ireland Fire and Rescue
OL,16,FService also attended the scene and
OL,17,Fextinguished the fire, which had caused
OL,18,Fsome smoke damage to the property.
OL,20,FOne person was in the house at the
OL,21,Ftime, but no injuries were reported.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
